  "description": "The ford explorer floor mats have a deep molded tread pattern that captures and holds all dirt, water, snow, and spills to prevent them from hitting the carpet. 2015-2019 ford explorer floor mats are easy to clean and will never fall off, and will not accumulate stains or accumulations. Give your car carpet a new look, fast and easy.\nFeatures\nDurability. One of the best things about OEDRO floor mats is that they are developed with strong rubber. This gives them longevity in comparison to other styles of mats. The floor mats are quite flexible. The heavy-duty material is also capable of withstanding constant rubbing and contacting of shoes.\nExcellent Visual Appearance. By adding an all-weather floor liner to your car’s interior, you will add color and class to your car. The mat’s unique appearance will accentuate the interior look of your car tenfold.\nProtecting the Interior. OEDRO Floor mats offer vehicles perhaps the most comprehensive interior protection in comparison to any other car mat. Your car’s carpet will remain clean and dry at all times.\nCleaning these Mats is Quite Easy. The materials used for creating floor mats are extremely simple to wash and clean. You can easily wash and clean the spillage on top of it. You can also spray it using soap and water. Also, there won’t be any odor remaining once the mat dries out.\nIt Traps Dirt and Moisture. The waterproof surface of all-weather floor mats makes sure to trap any kind of spillage on top of it. The mats can also trap dust, sand, and other dry particles effectively.\n2-Year Warranty | Professional installation is highly recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible for 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 Ford Explorer.\nNote: Without 2nd Row Center Console.\nFits to 7 Seaters Only.",
